  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_036 (multimodal with imagenet_vit_l image encoder, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, avgpool aggregation, concat fusion) achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.7150). This experiment tests transformer aggregation in the same high-performing multimodal setup to isolate the effect of aggregation strategy. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether transformer aggregation could further improve performance compared to avgpool, while keeping other critical choices (image/RNA encoders, fusion method) fixed. This comparison is highly informative for optimizing the multimodal architecture without overcomplicating the design."
}

